- What you’ll see: Vigeland Park (Frognerparken), Aker Brygge, Royal Palace, City Hall, Akershus Fortress, and other central highlights
- Group size: small-group experience (operator notes up to 15 guests)
- What’s included: Professional guide; use of bike and helmet
- What’s not included: Food and drinks; entrance fees
- Cancellation policy: Free cancellation up to 24 hours before the tour start time
- Accessibility/fitness: Not wheelchair accessible; suitable for most fitness levels. Not recommended for travelers with spinal injuries or serious cardiovascular conditions. Specialized infant seats available.

